-- World fixes: holiday spawns appear in the right holiday (2026-11-18)
-- Found while fixing the Brew of the Month Club (Four, Brew Vendor 89830: "Vendor sells all brews all year").
-- Many holiday spawns in our dump are linked to the wrong game event compared with TDB 8.3.7:
--   - Pilgrim's Bounty (26) held Brewfest decorations, kegs, mugs and Brewfest Revelers (8.3.7: Brewfest 24) and
--     39 Darkmoon Faire banners plus 7 Stormwind Gypsy Wagons (8.3.7: Darkmoon Faire 3). Its own feast tables,
--     chairs, hostesses, pilgrims, pumpkins, haystacks, torches and cooking fires were on Brew of the Month May (41).
--   - Isle of Conquest emissaries, envoys and banners were on Brew of the Month June (42) (8.3.7: 54), and the six
--     Isle of Conquest Battlemasters only showed in June (8.3.7: always there).
--   - Strand of the Ancients emissaries and banners were on Edge of Madness, Wushoolay (30) (8.3.7: 53).
--   - The L70ETC concert band and stage were on Brew of the Month October (34) and WoW's 10th Anniversary (71)
--     (8.3.7: L70ETC Concert 32).
--   - Midsummer banners also showed in Winter Veil, Love is in the Air giants in Winter Veil, Lunar Festival
--     fireworks in Midsummer, Hallow's End bonfires sat on an event that doesn't exist (46), the Kalu'ak
--     derby's Elder Clearwater on Brew of the Month September (45), and the holiday commoners also on 32/40/41.
-- Method: every event-linked spawn of ours was matched to the 8.3.7 spawn of the same entry within 2 yards and
-- given that spawn's events. Without a position match, a spawn was moved only when every 8.3.7 spawn of its entry
-- sits on one event and our event is one of the mixed-up ones above. What was left on the Brew of the Month
-- events afterwards went with its set (Pilgrim's Bounty, L70ETC), and Brewfest-named leftovers on 26 went to 24.
-- Not changed: Darkmoon Faire spawns on event 3 (Almanac's audit), every spawn an earlier fix already set (city and
-- zone passes, love boats), critters and wild battle pets, Day of the Dead (8.3.7 puts its candles on an arena
-- season event), and spawns 8.3.7 doesn't have (for example the Orgrimmar signs and fires on 26). Event dates are
-- not changed here.
-- 3439 spawns relinked. Safe to run twice.

